      "name": "Heavier than a Duck - 2nd place SCGCon DC Grand Contest",
      "format": "Constructed",
      "primer": "<p><em>\"If she weighs the same as a duck, she's made of wood! And therefore... A witch! We shall use my largest scales.\"</em> - Monty Python and the Holy Grail</p><p><br></p><p><u>If the witches don't drown, they surely must burn - that's the (unfortunately historically accurate) theme for this Persecutor.</u></p><p><br></p><p>Before getting into the deck itself, I need to shout out to the giants whose shoulders I stand on - @grish, @ryutras, @franekstein, and @paladin_of_io all built awesome Persecutor lists before I did, and I relied heavily on their deck lists and expertise to help me create this one. You guys rock!</p><p><br></p><p>IN PROGRESS - More to come soon.</p><p><br></p><p>If you'd like to hear me talk about the deck, here is a link: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eKdgeQ5ZNI0&amp;t=203s\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eKdgeQ5ZNI0&amp;t=203s</a></p>",
